# Paper workspace.
#   paper/data/*.json and paper/hardware/*.json are small and ARE tracked --
#   they are the provenance trail for every number in the manuscript.
#   Figures: the .pdf is the paper asset and is tracked; the .png is a
#   throwaway preview and is not.
paper/figures/*.png
paper/figures/*.svg
paper/tex/*.aux
paper/tex/*.log
paper/tex/*.out
paper/tex/*.bbl
paper/tex/*.blg
paper/tex/*.synctex.gz
paper/tex/*.fdb_latexmk
paper/tex/*.fls
